{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/869157-help-understanding-namtaru-fear-of-revulsion","id":869157,"title":"Help understanding namtaru - fear of revulsion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-20T00:36:53-07:00","id":869157,"title":"Help understanding namtaru - fear of revulsion","content":"Hi all! as title says, im having some trouble figuring out exactly the 'purpose' of namtaru.<br /> <br /> Having read the book, the others seem to give both great obvious and thought provoking reasons for their fear (eg. exposure both literal and figurative), but i cant quite make a hack at namtaru.<br /> <br /> On the surface it seems to be 'fear of something revolting', something truly hideous that it is in and of itself terrifying. but how does this translate away from just the literal 'its ugly, so scary' which seems a bit uninspired compared to the rest? my best hack is kind of a mythos-esque, seeing something and understanding it, but it is not something one should know etc... but i dunno.<br /> <br /> Cheers in advance for helping me with my 'there are no dumb questions, just dumb people, i.e. me' question <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6683-planbisnotbail","name":"PlanBIsNotBail","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T02:49:38-07:00","id":869196,"title":"","content":"By 'fear of revulsion', they basically mean things that you recoil from, that you don't want to know or see. It could just be that it's hideously ugly. It could be that it tells you truths you don't want to hear but can't deny. The Namtaru are all about being the thing that you don't want to be in the same room as, not necessarily out of direct fear but for any reason. Namtaru are hideous, but they are also the truths that you don't want to accept, like that you re not the centre of the world, that people care for you only because you're like them. Namtaru are deviants, and the reason that people recoil from them is the same reason that people cross the road to avoid a hobo: they don't want to be contaminated.<br /> <br /> Sorry to just dump my thoughts out here, I know that they're probably not the most comprehensible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T06:14:57-07:00","id":869263,"title":"","content":"Ah cool! no, your thoughts are fantastic! theyre not just something 'hideous', theyre something unpleasant that youre forced to confront!<br /> <br /> Thanks so much for clearing that up, i knew i must have just been reading it wrong.<br /> <br /> Cheers for putting up with my shenanigans!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6683-planbisnotbail","name":"PlanBIsNotBail","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T10:54:49-07:00","id":869432,"title":"","content":"Or it could be a warning message.<br /> <br /> Similar to all the 'atomic monster' movies where nuclear testing gave way to many-tentacled eyeballs and swarms of giant insects. Pollution can lead way to gross mutation. Or the videos you might have been shown in drivers or sex education classes about the dangers of not driving or having sex safely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-20-2016, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T15:01:29-07:00","id":869691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/869157-help-understanding-namtaru-fear-of-revulsion?p=869432#post869432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or it could be a warning message.<br /> <br /> Similar to all the 'atomic monster' movies where nuclear testing gave way to many-tentacled eyeballs and swarms of giant insects. Pollution can lead way to gross mutation. Or the videos you might have been shown in drivers or sex education classes about the dangers of not driving or having sex safely.</div> </div> </div> </div> So a relatively benevolent Namtaru can act like the members of the Scarecrow Ministry from Changeling: they use a combination of disturbing facts, urban legends and a fraction of their powers to scare people straight for their own safety. Both can be hypocrites and go overboard, of course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-21T09:53:56-07:00","id":870297,"title":"","content":"I interpreted the Namtaru as the &quot;Fear of Infection&quot;. Rooted I'm sure in much of humans fear of the diseased and different, that the unclean thing that you see may somehow change you in the same way. It reminded me a bit of David Cronenberg's concepts of Body Horror. For the record, I'm not disagreeing with anyone else's perspective, just saying this is what I immediately thought of when I read Namtaru.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10415-vermillionde","name":"VermillionDe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}